<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Keio Textbook Market</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;500;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <main class="shell">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Keio-only textbook exchange</p>
      <h1>授業ごとの教科書事情まで見える、慶應生向けマーケット。</h1>
      <p class="hero-copy">授業名、担当教員、学部、キャンパスから教科書を探して、状態や受け渡し場所を見ながらやり取りできる。</p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <article>
          <strong><%= users.length %></strong>
          <span>登録ユーザー</span>
        </article>
        <article>
          <strong><%= listings.length %></strong>
          <span>表示中の出品</span>
        </article>
        <article>
          <strong><%= transactions.length %></strong>
          <span>進行中の取引</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="insight-grid">
      <article class="panel spotlight">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>Marketplace Snapshot</h2>
          <p>いま出ている教科書の傾向を、価格や学部分布からまとめて確認できる。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="snapshot-metrics">
          <article>
            <span>平均価格</span>
            <strong>¥<%= insights.averagePrice.toLocaleString() %></strong>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>最多学部</span>
            <strong><%= insights.topFaculty.label %></strong>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>学部人数</span>
            <strong><%= insights.topFaculty.count %>人</strong>
          </article>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel chart-panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>キャンパス分布</h2>
          <p>どのキャンパスで受け渡ししやすい出品が多いかを見られる。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-list">
          <% insights.campusDistribution.forEach(item => { %>
            <div class="chart-row">
              <div class="chart-meta">
                <strong><%= item.label %></strong>
                <span><%= item.count %>件</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chart-bar">
                <span style="width: <%= item.ratio %>%"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel chart-panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>取引状態</h2>
          <p>公開中、取引中、売却済みの件数をまとめて確認できる。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="chart-list">
          <% insights.statusDistribution.forEach(item => { %>
            <div class="chart-row">
              <div class="chart-meta">
                <strong><%= item.label %></strong>
                <span><%= item.count %>件</span>
              </div>
              <div class="chart-bar status-bar">
                <span class="<%= String(item.label).toLowerCase() %>" style="width: <%= item.ratio %>%"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>必須度が高い教科書</h2>
          <p>授業で使う頻度が高かった教科書を優先してチェックできる。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="priority-list">
          <% insights.topPriorityListings.forEach(item => { %>
            <article class="priority-card">
              <span class="priority-score"><%= item.requiredLevel %>/5</span>
              <div>
                <strong><%= item.title %></strong>
                <p><%= item.courseName %> / <%= item.campus %></p>
              </div>
            </article>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="grid two-up">
      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>出品一覧</h2>
          <p>書名や授業名で探して、学部・キャンパス・価格順で絞り込める。</p>
        </div>
        <form id="search-form" class="stack">
          <input type="text" name="q" placeholder="書名・説明・授業名で検索" value="<%= filters.q %>">
          <input type="text" name="courseName" placeholder="授業名" value="<%= filters.courseName %>">
          <input type="text" name="instructorName" placeholder="担当教員" value="<%= filters.instructorName %>">
          <select name="faculty">
            <option value="">全学部</option>
            <% faculties.forEach(faculty => { %>
              <option value="<%= faculty %>" <%= filters.faculty === faculty ? "selected" : "" %>><%= faculty %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <select name="campus">
            <option value="">全キャンパス</option>
            <% campuses.forEach(campus => { %>
              <option value="<%= campus %>" <%= filters.campus === campus ? "selected" : "" %>><%= campus %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <select name="status">
            <option value="">全ステータス</option>
            <% transactionStatuses.forEach(status => { %>
              <option value="<%= status %>" <%= filters.status === status ? "selected" : "" %>><%= status %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <select name="sort">
            <% sortOptions.forEach(option => { %>
              <option value="<%= option.value %>" <%= filters.sort === option.value ? "selected" : "" %>><%= option.label %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <button type="submit">一覧を更新</button>
        </form>
        <div id="listing-results" class="listing-grid">
          <% listings.forEach(listing => { %>
            <article class="listing-card">
              <div class="listing-top">
                <span class="status <%= String(listing.status).toLowerCase() %>"><%= listing.status %></span>
                <strong>¥<%= listing.price.toLocaleString() %></strong>
              </div>
              <h3><a href="/listings/<%= listing.id %>"><%= listing.title %></a></h3>
              <p><%= listing.courseName %> / <%= listing.instructorName %></p>
              <p><%= listing.description %></p>
              <dl>
                <div><dt>状態</dt><dd><%= listing.condition %></dd></div>
                <div><dt>書込</dt><dd><%= listing.markingType %></dd></div>
                <div><dt>出品者</dt><dd><%= listing.sellerName %>（<%= listing.seller.faculty %>）</dd></div>
                <div><dt>受渡</dt><dd><%= listing.meetingPlace %></dd></div>
                <div><dt>キャンパス</dt><dd><%= listing.campus %></dd></div>
                <div><dt>必須度</dt><dd><%= listing.requiredLevel %>/5</dd></div>
              </dl>
              <div class="card-actions">
                <a class="button-link" href="/listings/<%= listing.id %>">詳細を見る</a>
                <% if (listing.status !== "COMPLETED") { %>
                  <button type="button" data-sold-button data-id="<%= listing.id %>">売却済みにする</button>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </article>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>教科書を出品</h2>
          <p>教科書名、授業名、状態、受け渡し場所などを入力して出品する。</p>
        </div>
        <form id="listing-form" class="stack">
          <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="教科書名" required>
          <input type="number" name="price" min="0" placeholder="価格" required>
          <textarea name="description" placeholder="説明" rows="4" required></textarea>
          <input type="text" name="courseName" placeholder="授業名" required>
          <input type="text" name="instructorName" placeholder="担当教員" required>
          <select name="condition" required>
            <option value="">本の状態</option>
            <% listingConditions.forEach(condition => { %>
              <option value="<%= condition %>"><%= condition %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <select name="markingType" required>
            <option value="">書き込みの有無</option>
            <% markingTypes.forEach(markingType => { %>
              <option value="<%= markingType %>"><%= markingType %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <input type="text" name="meetingPlace" placeholder="受け渡し場所" required>
          <input type="text" name="campus" placeholder="キャンパス 例: 日吉">
          <input type="number" name="requiredLevel" min="1" max="5" placeholder="授業での必須度 1-5">
          <textarea name="requiredComment" placeholder="実際どれくらい使ったか" rows="3"></textarea>
          <select name="sellerId" required>
            <option value="">出品者</option>
            <% users.forEach(user => { %>
              <option value="<%= user.id %>"><%= user.name %> / <%= user.faculty %> / <%= user.campus %></option>
            <% }) %>
          </select>
          <button type="submit">出品する</button>
        </form>
        <p id="listing-feedback" class="feedback"></p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="grid two-up">
      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>慶應メールで登録</h2>
          <p>`@keio.jp` のメール、学部、キャンパス、空きコマを入力する。</p>
        </div>
        <form id="user-form" class="stack">
          <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="氏名" required>
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="xxx@keio.jp" required>
          <input type="text" name="faculty" placeholder="学部" required>
          <input type="text" name="campus" placeholder="所属キャンパス" required>
          <input type="text" name="freePeriods" placeholder="空きコマ 例: 月3, 水4" required>
          <button type="submit">登録する</button>
        </form>
        <p id="user-feedback" class="feedback"></p>
      </article>

      <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <h2>取引チャット</h2>
          <p>購入希望の後に、受け渡し場所や時間を相談できる。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="transaction-list">
          <% transactions.forEach(transaction => { %>
            <article class="transaction-card">
              <div class="listing-top">
                <span class="status <%= String(transaction.status).toLowerCase() %>"><%= transaction.status %></span>
                <strong><%= transaction.listing.title %></strong>
              </div>
              <p>買い手: <%= transaction.buyer.name %> / 売り手: <%= transaction.seller.name %></p>
              <p>受け渡し案: <%= transaction.meetingPlan %></p>
              <div class="messages">
                <% transaction.messages.forEach(message => { %>
                  <div class="message">
                    <strong><%= message.sender.name %></strong>
                    <span><%= message.body %></span>
                  </div>
                <% }) %>
              </div>
            </article>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script src="/app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
